WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.003
Outside the restaurant, Toad stared at the car.

2
00:00:20.004 --> 00:00:25.815
"It has a big engine," said Toad.

3
00:00:25.816 --> 00:00:28.489
He touched the car door.

4
00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:31.413
His fingers trembled.

5
00:00:31.414 --> 00:00:36.871
"Vroom," Toad said under his breath.

6
00:00:36.872 --> 00:00:39.753
He kicked the tires lightly.

7
00:00:39.754 --> 00:00:44.338
"What shiny wheels!" he said.

8
00:00:44.339 --> 00:00:48.357
"They could handle any kind of road."

9
00:00:48.358 --> 00:00:53.476
Without thinking, Toad hopped inside.

10
00:00:53.477 --> 00:00:59.208
"Ohh, the seats are leather!" he cried.

11
00:00:59.209 --> 00:01:03.538
Toad saw the key still in the car.

12
00:01:03.539 --> 00:01:09.479
"I wonder what it sounds like?" thought Toad.

13
00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:14.418
His hand shook as he reached out.

14
00:01:14.419 --> 00:01:17.671
"Should I?" asked Toad.

15
00:01:17.672 --> 00:01:19.798
Then he smiled.

16
00:01:19.799 --> 00:01:25.484
"Why not? Just one little turn of the key."

17
00:01:25.485 --> 00:01:30.750
Toad turned the key and the engine roared.

18
00:01:30.751 --> 00:01:34.204
Vroom! Vroom!

19
00:01:34.205 --> 00:01:39.416
"I wonder how fast it goes," said Toad.

20
00:01:39.417 --> 00:01:44.474
Toad drove out of the parking lot.

21
00:01:44.475 --> 00:01:50.812
"It feels so good to drive again!" yelled Toad.

22
00:01:50.813 --> 00:01:53.499
He stepped on the gas pedal.

23
00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:55.540
Vroom!

24
00:01:55.541 --> 00:01:59.469
Toad sped down the road.

25
00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:03.935
He lost all thoughts of right and wrong.

26
00:02:03.936 --> 00:02:08.668
"Toad the Road Warrior!

27
00:02:08.669 --> 00:02:13.536
Lord of the Trail!" yelled Toad.

28
00:02:13.537 --> 00:02:18.675
"I am King of the Road!"

29
00:02:18.676 --> 00:02:22.348
He didn't know where he was going.

30
00:02:22.349 --> 00:02:25.270
He didn't care who saw him.

31
00:02:25.271 --> 00:02:28.070
Only one thing mattered.

32
00:02:28.071 --> 00:02:32.591
He was driving again!
